              "end": 4,
              "start": 4
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Judith L. French, on behalf of the State Petitioners, the Ohio Scholarship and Tutorial Program was enacted in 1995 in response to an unprecedented educational crisis."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Ms. French",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "69a4592a66f4d0fa4212415449964372272f732bb139f6cc969560f892a82831",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-69a4592a66f4-0001-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 19,
              "start": 19
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Ms. French, petitioners argue the program differs from the Nyquist program because it lacks a nondiscrimination provision and is intended to aid private schools."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Robert H. Chanin",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "69a4592a66f4d0fa4212415449964372272f732bb139f6cc969560f892a82831",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-69a4592a66f4-0002-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 37,
              "start": 37
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Robert H. Chanin, respondents contend that transferring public funds to sectarian schools violates the Establishment Clause."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "State petitioners",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "69a4592a66f4d0fa4212415449964372272f732bb139f6cc969560f892a82831",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-69a4592a66f4-0003-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 69,
              "start": 69
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "State petitioners maintain that the schools receiving aid are considered public schools."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "State petitioners",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "69a4592a66f4d0fa4212415449964372272f732bb139f6cc969560f892a82831",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-69a4592a66f4-0003-0006"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 70,
              "start": 70
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to State petitioners, community schools do not charge tuition."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Respondents",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "69a4592a66f4d0fa4212415449964372272f732bb139f6cc969560f892a82831",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-69a4592a66f4-0004-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 71,
              "start": 71
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Respondents, respondents seek to exclude religious schools as an option under the program."
      }
